---
import DocsNav from "../../components/DocsNav.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { executionStages, repositoryUrl } from "../../data/site";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Documentation | Loom Infer"
  description="Architecture, contracts, validation, and evidence for Loom Infer."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Documentation</p>
    <h1>Start with the operator boundary.</h1>
    <p>
      Loom Infer provides contracts, plans, CUDA execution, and completion.
      The engine keeps model, request, and scheduling policy.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="docs-layout">
    <DocsNav active="Start" />
    <article class="prose">
      <h2>Read in this order</h2>
      <div class="doc-grid">
        <div class="doc-card">
          <span class="card-index">01 / DESIGN</span>
          <h3>Architecture</h3>
          <p>Understand ownership, planning, submission, and completion.</p>
          <a href={`${repositoryUrl}/blob/main/docs/design/loom-infer-architecture.md`}>Open architecture →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-card">
          <span class="card-index">02 / SURFACE</span>
          <h3>Operator catalog</h3>
          <p>Check each admitted dtype, layout, algorithm, and open gate.</p>
          <a href={`${repositoryUrl}/blob/main/docs/operator-catalog.md`}>Open catalog →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-card">
          <span class="card-index">03 / PROOF</span>
          <h3>Evidence index</h3>
          <p>Inspect source revisions, methods, raw samples, and exclusions.</p>
          <a href={`${repositoryUrl}/blob/main/docs/results/README.md`}>Open evidence →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-card">
          <span class="card-index">04 / DEVICE</span>
          <h3>H20 validation</h3>
          <p>Run correctness, sanitizer, Graph, and performance gates separately.</p>
          <a href={`${repositoryUrl}/blob/main/docs/development/h20-validation.md`}>Open validation guide →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>Execution lifecycle</h2>
      <p>Every operator follows the same checked path.</p>
      <ol>
        {executionStages.map((stage) => (
          <li><strong>{stage.name}.</strong> {stage.detail}</li>
        ))}
      </ol>
      <pre><code>let plan = provider.plan(spec)?;
let mut bindings = queue.bindings(capacity)?;

let mut scope = queue.begin(bindings)?;
plan.enqueue_into(&mut scope, args)?;
bindings = scope.finish().wait()?;</code></pre>

      <div class="doc-note">
        <strong>Graph capture uses the same plan.</strong>
        <p>Fixed-address Graph execution retains providers, bindings, functions, and completion resources.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>Validate a checkout</h2>
      <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/feichai0017/loom-infer.git
cd loom-infer
make check

# On the pinned CUDA host
make cuda-doctor
make cuda-check
make h20</code></pre>
      <p>
        Device records apply only to their declared source, hardware, contract,
        and measurement. A correctness record does not imply a performance or
        serving result.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
